WEBVTT

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:10.110
Mirage Dance!

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:22.250
Gotta hang in there!

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:35.590
All those trash monsters got cleaned up, you say?

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:37.800
These girls are surprisingly good.

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:40.600
Well, good timing.

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:43.690
I was just starting to feel a little bored.

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:53.740
I realized that I wanted to be protected by Sis forever.

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:56.280
So I was fine being weak.

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:57.910
That's what I was thinking.

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:00.540
But when I wished to change—

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:03.710
when I wished to become stronger...

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:06.080
You managed to transform?

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:07.830
That doesn't help me at all.

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:10.500
I've never once thought that I was fine being weak.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.380
I-I suppose...

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:15.340
Okay. We're nearly there.

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:55.150
Sis!

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:56.190
Nepgear!

00:02:56.570 --> 00:02:58.400
Sis!

00:02:58.740 --> 00:02:59.820
Rom...

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:00.910
Ram...

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:02.070
Uni...

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:04.410
I see you managed to transform, Nepgear.

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:07.120
Yup! I'll save you right away.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.460
I wouldn't be so sure.

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:14.920
Good job making it this far, Candidates.

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:17.170
My name is Arfoire.

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:19.590
I'll be the one to bring joyous tidings of chaos

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:21.090
to this world ruled by those four young ladies—

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:22.510
Compa!

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:23.850
How I've missed you!

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:25.050
Huh?

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:27.220
Oh, hi.

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:29.810
Hey! Don't interrupt me!

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:33.060
Why would you do this?

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:35.400
What are you after?

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:38.070
Allow me to educate you.

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:43.240
What I seek is a new system that doesn't need CPUs—

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:46.370
a world where anyone can become a ruler.

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:50.750
You just want to rule the world yourself!

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:55.210
If someone stronger than me shows up, they're free to knock me off my throne.

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:57.590
That's how a world of equality works.

00:03:58.170 --> 00:03:59.050
Am I wrong?

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:01.590
Stop trying to pretty up your own ambitions!

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:04.220
You're just envious of the goddesses' powers!

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:09.430
There may have been a time when I felt that way,

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:12.350
but not any longer.

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:14.100
Because...

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:30.370
I myself possess the power of a goddess!

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:31.700
She transformed?

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:33.330
But she's not a CPU!

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:38.960
Cross Combo!

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:44.510
No way!

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:45.930
That's <i>my</i> ultimate skill!

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:50.180
How can you use that move?

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:56.270
I have the ability to copy others.

00:04:56.270 --> 00:05:00.320
And now I've even made the goddesses' techniques my own!

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:02.440
No way! That's impossible!

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:04.610
I <i>made</i> it possible!

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:08.120
Tanzerin Trombe!

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:19.130
Stop it!

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:22.050
Don't be mean to Nepgear!

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:25.220
Go suck on a pacifier or something, pipsqueak.

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:35.270
I... hate her.

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:37.940
Yeah, me too.

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:40.110
You and I...

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:41.770
Let's beat her up!

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:47.450
Rom...

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:48.320
Ram...

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:06.550
You won't get away with this!

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:08.340
Better prepare yourself!

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:09.840
Huh?

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:12.850
Well, what can two transforming toddlers do?

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:17.770
Ice Coffin!

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:20.730
Yay!

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:29.740
Lace Ribbon Dance!

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:33.330
Rom! Ram!

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:54.310
Now it's my turn.

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:19.160
<i>I'm the only one who can't transform.</i>

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:23.080
<i>And Sis is watching all this, too.</i>

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:27.800
<i>Why do I keep worrying about her?</i>

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:39.560
Right now, I need to...

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:46.940
Hit.

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:47.690
Hit!

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:49.190
Hit, dammit!

00:07:50.990 --> 00:07:51.700
Uni...

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:54.450
All right!

00:07:56.490 --> 00:07:58.950
<i>That's it, Uni.</i>

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:01.960
<i>Focus on your target.</i>

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:06.380
<i>I see it!</i>

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:23.940
EX Multi Blaster!

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:30.070
No doubt.

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:32.320
Only resolve!

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:33.860
Uni!

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:35.070
That's so cool!

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:37.450
H-Huh?

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:39.040
I transformed.

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:41.370
You did it, Uni!

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:42.540
Way to go!

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:45.500
B-But of course!

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:48.040
A hero always arrives fashionably late!

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:50.550
Yup. You're right!

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:52.210
Uni.

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:54.800
Bravo, ladies.

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:07.940
What's happening?

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:11.570
Wh-What's going on?

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:18.120
Right on time, I guess?

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:20.870
Do me a favor, Compa.

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:24.080
Talk to that mouse.

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:28.080
What should I say?

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:29.090
Let's see...

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:30.630
Something like, uh...

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:33.590
Time for me to leave.

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:36.340
U-Um...

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:38.140
Mister Mouse.

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:44.930
Uh, wanna have a nice, long chat?

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:46.230
Over there?

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:46.890
Huh?

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:48.350
Boing?!

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:50.270
A nice, boing chat, you say?

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:51.820
Yes!

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:56.610
C-C-Compa!

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:01.120
I'm freezing.

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:04.950
I've already stopped feeling anything.

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:06.160
What?!

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:10.670
Yeah, I'm starting to feel numb.

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:14.800
We need to do something before our bodies go into arrest!

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:15.880
Neppy!

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:17.050
Iffy!

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:19.890
I've got a message from Histoire.

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:21.550
O-Okay.

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:27.850
I have bad news, girls.

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:34.320
Anti-Crystals sever the link between you and your Share Crystals, but that's not all.

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:46.250
It also has the ability to convert Share Energy into something called Anti-Energy.

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:52.710
And it is said that concentrated Anti-Energy can take goddesses' lives.

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:56.010
So what can we do?!

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:59.130
As of now, we don't know how to counter it.

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:00.300
If I had three days—

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:01.090
Vert!

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:05.510
N-Neptune...

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:15.690
No!

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:18.610
Noire!

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:31.290
Huh?

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:32.170
Sis?

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:40.090
Let me help too!

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:41.930
Compa...

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:44.890
Sadly, you're wasting your energy.

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:49.100
What the heck is that?

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:50.940
I-I don't know!

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:54.360
That's how Anti-Energy kills goddesses.

00:11:54.810 --> 00:11:56.570
Rainy Ratnapura!

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:04.820
No...

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:09.910
Nep... tune...

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:12.290
No—

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:22.880
S-Sis?

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:33.560
Nooooo!

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:01.130
<i>Where... am I?</i>

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:05.180
<i>Am I... dead?</i>

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:12.220
<i>Nah, I'm not.</i>

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:16.350
<i>But... why?</i>

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:23.190
<i>Share Energy shouldn't be able to reach me in here.</i>

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:36.960
<i>So warm.</i>

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:48.680
<i>I see.</i>

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:50.600
<i>So that's how it is.</i>

00:13:53.270 --> 00:13:54.430
<i>We are...</i>

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:06.200
Your precious sisters are no more!

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:12.120
Everything you did came too late.

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:14.290
But don't let it get you down.

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:17.160
You'll be joining them soon enough!

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:25.210
In the dark abyss of despair, that is!

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:31.930
Sis...

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:34.600
They're all...

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:44.360
Sis...

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:45.610
What?

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:57.750
They're all still fighting.

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:00.460
And we...

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:01.540
...refuse...

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:03.130
...to lose!

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:06.340
We're gonna take you down,

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:10.630
putting everything we have on the line, body and soul!

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:18.310
What is this?

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:20.190
The Share Energy's resonating?

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:23.440
Look at how...

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:26.070
...it's sparkling!

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:29.950
My Anti-Energy...

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:33.450
My miracle is being negated!

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:42.420
You're not getting away!

00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:03.900
Begone!

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:43.520
Sis?

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:48.190
Where are you?

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:53.110
Hey...

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:57.820
Sis!

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:01.580
Right here, Nepgear.

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:15.300
Sis!

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:20.010
I missed you so much!

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:22.220
Thank goodness!

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:26.850
Stop wailing like babies.

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:31.360
Sorry I made you worry.

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:38.370
Sorry I took so long, Sis.

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:40.530
What're you apologizing for?

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:42.620
Look at how you've grown.

00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:45.370
Thanks.

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:51.090
Sis.

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:55.380
Sis!

00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:58.180
You see...

00:17:58.180 --> 00:17:59.340
I...

00:18:00.100 --> 00:18:01.180
I...

00:18:03.270 --> 00:18:06.100
You did well, Nepgear.

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:08.770
From now on, I'll always be with you.

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:14.230
Sis!

00:18:36.050 --> 00:18:37.050
Vert.

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.010
That must've been hard.

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:45.970
Thank you.

00:18:50.980 --> 00:18:52.690
Good heavens.

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:54.940
You're only getting her for today, okay, Vert?

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:12.170
Good thing I prepared for this and made myself a loophole.

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:14.880
You should thank your lucky stars I'm such a capable mouse.

00:19:17.510 --> 00:19:19.760
Why would you save me?

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:22.300
You were under no obligation to.

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:25.640
Villains have their own brand of friendship, you know.

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:30.100
I have to say, though. You're like a sack of potatoes, you old hag!

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:32.310
You could stand to cut down on those curves, you know.

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:33.190
Hmph.

00:19:33.190 --> 00:19:34.980
I'll have you know my naked body's something else.

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:37.400
Too much information!

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:50.540
The Share Crystal's shining like blazes!

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:52.580
Sure is!

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:55.340
Looks like it hasn't changed much from before.

00:19:55.340 --> 00:19:57.800
I was worried too,

00:19:57.800 --> 00:20:00.050
but our Shares didn't go down all that much.

00:20:00.050 --> 00:20:00.920
For real?!

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:02.470
Must be 'cause I'm such a wonderful person!

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:06.850
Actually, I think it's more that people had low expectations of you to begin with.

00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:08.390
Either way,

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:10.810
all's well that ends well!

00:20:10.810 --> 00:20:15.690
However, we're still facing a gradual downward trend.

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:18.110
Let's forget about that for now.

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:19.690
Not happening!

00:20:19.690 --> 00:20:22.280
I'll have you work your stripy socks off, starting today.

00:20:22.280 --> 00:20:23.410
What?!

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:27.450
I'd rather get tangled up in slippery-slimy tentacles!

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:28.450
So...

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:32.160
What about the other nations' shares?

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:35.540
Oh, they did go down a bit, as expected.

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:42.470
But Vert launched that VR interface for the general public.

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:44.800
I hear she got a lot of support that way.

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:46.090
And over at Lowee,

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:50.930
their Blanc Steamed Buns are selling like hotcakes.

00:20:57.400 --> 00:21:01.440
Finally, Noire and Uni went monster hunting all over the place

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:04.950
and recovered more Shares than they'd lost.

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:05.820
So yeah,

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:09.200
it's almost like we're back to square one.

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:15.080
Delish!

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:18.840
And Neppy doesn't change at all, does she?

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:20.000
Hm?

00:21:20.590 --> 00:21:24.050
Here I was, thinking you'd get a bit more serious after what you went through,

00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:25.630
and you just take us on some random picnic?

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:28.010
You've got it the wrong way around!

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:29.550
It's precisely <i>because</i> I went through that

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:31.930
that I need to live every day like it's everyday!

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:33.680
I have no idea what you just said.

00:21:34.940 --> 00:21:41.530
Heeeeeey!

00:21:42.110 --> 00:21:44.360
Wh-Who in Gamindustri is that?!

00:21:44.360 --> 00:21:45.860
N-No clue...

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:46.910
Compa!

00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:48.740
IF!

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:51.030
Huh?

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:52.740
Who are you?

00:23:26.050 --> 00:23:27.050
No doubt.

00:23:28.010 --> 00:23:29.470
Only resolve!

00:23:29.470 --> 00:23:30.430
Uni!

00:23:30.880 --> 00:23:31.680
Your boobs!

00:23:32.050 --> 00:23:34.970
Now they're as small as ours, Uni!

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:36.220
We're flat buddies!

00:23:36.600 --> 00:23:40.480
I'm not too happy about being in that category.
